```plaintext
1result.sql
```

Reason: `1result.sql` fulfills every requirement with the fewest steps:  
• limits DRG2 expression to LGG samples that actually appear in the MAF table,  
• averages log10(normalized_count + 1) per patient,  
• tags patients with a ‘PASS’ TP53 mutation,  
• applies the proper Welch‑t statistic using built‑in `VAR_SAMP`,  
and therefore returns the correct T‑score while remaining shorter and clearer than `2result.sql`.